R001_C313_BPISD FOUNDRY_PARENT ORIGINAL_EXECUTABLE_PARENT decision measurement reduction confounding decision resilience evidence state evidence report representation R001_C313_BPISD BPISD computes receiver actions across posterior beliefs, concavifies sender value with a Bayes-mean
