R006_P579_P580_UTDIM FOUNDRY_PARENT ORIGINAL_EXECUTABLE_PARENT dynamics transport calibration transfer state report R006_P579_P580_UTDIM UTDIM reconstructs the two-scalar transport shell as an explicit linear dynamical system. It scans
